},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"Xin lỗi, tôi bị lạc.\". Cũng đúng: \"Xin lỗi, tôi bị lạc đường.\", \"Xin lỗi, mình bị lạc.\".","gradingRule":{"acceptedText":["Xin lỗi, tôi bị lạc.","Xin lỗi, tôi bị lạc đường.","Xin lỗi, mình bị lạc.","Xin lỗi, mình bị lạc đường."],"caseSensitive":false,"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":true},"hint":"\"excuse me\" = xin lỗi (bắt chuyện); \"lost\" = bị lạc","id":"u10n7l2-e06","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"Excuse me, I am lost."},"skillIds":["u10.grammar"],"type":"textTranslation","vocabularyIds":["u1.excuse_me","u10.lost"]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"Tom wants a blue shirt."},{"id":"c2","text":"Water, please."},{"id":"c3","text":"We can walk to the bridge."}]},"explanation":"Bạn nghe: \"We can walk to the bridge.\" (Chúng ta có thể đi bộ đến cây cầu.).","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c3","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Câu có nghĩa: \"Chúng ta có thể đi bộ đến cây cầu.\"","id":"u10n7l2-e07","nonAudioAlternative":{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"Tom wants a blue shirt."},{"id":"c2","text":"Water, please."},{"id":"c3","text":"We can walk to the bridge."}]},"explanation":"Bạn nghe: \"We can walk to the bridge.\" (Chúng ta có thể đi bộ đến cây cầu.).","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c3","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Câu có nghĩa: \"Chúng ta có thể đi bộ đến cây cầu.\"","id":"u10n7l2-e07a","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Chọn câu tiếng Anh có nghĩa: \"Chúng ta có thể đi bộ đến cây cầu.\""},"skillIds":["listening","u10.grammar"],"type":"choice","vocabularyIds":["u7.can","u10.bridge","u10.walk"]},"prompt":{"audioAssetId":"a.u10.s30.n","locale":"vi-VN","text":"Nghe và chọn câu bạn nghe được"},"skillIds":["listening","u10.grammar"],"type":"listenChoice","vocabularyIds":["u7.can","u10.bridge","u10.walk"]},{"content":{"locale":"en-US","maxSeconds":12,"referenceText":"Yes, it is not far."},"explanation":"Câu trả lời mẫu: \"Yes, it is not far.\". Cũng đúng: \"Yes, I can.\", \"Yes, it's not far.\".","gradingRule":{"acceptedText":["Yes, it is not far.","Yes, I can.","Yes, it's not far.","Yes, it isn't far."],"caseSensitive":false,"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":true},"hint":"Gợi ý trả lời: \"Vâng, không xa lắm.\"","id":"u10n7l2-e08","nonSpeechAlternative":{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"Yes, it is not far."},{"id":"c2","text":"At the market."},{"id":"c3","text":"The answer is ten."}]},"explanation":"Câu trả lời mẫu: \"Yes, it is not far.\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c1","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Gợi ý trả lời: \"Vâng, không xa lắm.\"","id":"u10n7l2-e08a","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"\"Can you walk there?\" — chọn câu trả lời phù hợp"},"skillIds":["speaking","u10.dialogue"],"type":"choice","vocabularyIds":["u1.yes","u7.can","u10.far","u10.walk"]},"prompt":{"audioAssetId":"a.u10.d4.n","locale":"en-US","text":"Can you walk there?"},"skillIds":["speaking","u10.dialogue"],"type":"dialogueTurn","vocabularyIds":["u1.yes","u7.can","u10.far","u10.walk"]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"Next to the park"},{"id":"c2","text":"On the bridge"},{"id":"c3","text":"Next to the bank"}],"passage":"On Saturday, Tom wants to go to the bookshop. He walks from his house, but the city is big and he is lost. He does not have a map. He asks a woman, \"Excuse me, where is the bookshop?\" \"Go straight on this street. Turn left at the bank. The bookshop is next to the park, opposite the hospital.\" \"Is it far?\" \"No, it is near. You can walk.\" Tom finds the bookshop. Mai is there too! \"You are not lost now,\" she laughs.","question":"Where is the bookshop?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"Next to the park\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c1","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Tom bị lạc\".","id":"u10n7l2-e09","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"Where is the bookshop?"},"skillIds":["reading","u10.story"],"type":"storyQuestion","vocabularyIds":[]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","imageAssetId":"i.u10.bridge","text":"bridge"},{"id":"c2","imageAssetId":"i.u4.bag","text":"bag"},{"id":"c3","imageAssetId":"i.u6.door","text":"door"},{"id":"c4","imageAssetId":"i.u10.park","text":"park"}]},"explanation":"\"park\" = \"công viên\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c4","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"\"công viên\" là \"park\".","id":"u10n7l2-e10","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Hình nào là \"công viên\"?"},"skillIds":["u10.vocab"],"type":"imageChoice","vocabularyIds":["u10.park"]},{"content":{"pairs":[{"id":"p1","left":{"id":"p1l","text":"next to"},"right":{"id":"p1r","text":"bên cạnh"}},{"id":"p2","left":{"id":"p2l","text":"opposite"},"right":{"id":"p2r","text":"đối diện"}},{"id":"p3","left":{"id":"p3l","text":"right"},"right":{"id":"p3r","text":"bên phải"}},{"id":"p4","left":{"id":"p4l","text":"far"},"right":{"id":"p4r","text":"xa"}},{"id":"p5","left":{"id":"p5l","text":"corner"},"right":{"id":"p5r","text":"góc đường"}}]},"explanation":"next to = bên cạnh; opposite = đối diện; right = bên phải; far = xa; corner = góc đường","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctPairIds":["p1","p2","p3","p4","p5"],"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Ví dụ: \"next to\" = \"bên cạnh\".","id":"u10n7l2-e11","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Nối các cặp từ tương ứng"},"skillIds":["u10.vocab"],"type":"matchPairs","vocabularyIds":["u10.next_to","u10.opposite","u10.right","u10.far","u10.corner"]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"building"},{"id":"c2","text":"next to"},{"id":"c3","text":"corner"},{"id":"c4","text":"kitchen"}]},"explanation":"\"corner\" = \"góc đường\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c3","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"\"corner\" nghĩa là \"góc đường\".","id":"u10n7l2-e12","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"\"góc đường\" trong tiếng Anh là gì?"},"skillIds":["u10.vocab"],"type":"choice","vocabularyIds":["u10.corner"]},{"content":{"locale":"en-US","maxSeconds":8,"referenceText":"Ho Chi Minh City is very big."},"explanation":"Câu mẫu: \"Ho Chi Minh City is very big.\".","gradingRule":{"acceptedText":["Ho Chi Minh City is very big."],"caseSensitive":false,"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":true},"hint":"Nghĩa: \"Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh rất lớn.\"","id":"u10n7l2-e13","nonSpeechAlternative":{"content":{"tokens":[{"id":"t1","text":"City"},{"id":"t2","text":"Minh"},{"id":"t3","text":"Ho"},{"id":"t4","text":"Chi"},{"id":"t5","text":"big"},{"id":"t6","text":"is"},{"id":"t7","text":"very"}]},"explanation":"Câu đúng: \"Ho Chi Minh City is very big.\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctTokenIds":["t3","t4","t2","t1","t6","t7","t5"],"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Câu bắt đầu bằng \"Ho\".","id":"u10n7l2-e13a","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Sắp xếp thành câu đúng: \"Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh rất lớn.\""},"skillIds":["speaking","u10.grammar"],"type":"sentenceOrder","vocabularyIds":["u6.big","u10.city"]},"prompt":{"audioAssetId":"a.u10.s19.n","locale":"en-US","text":"Nói câu sau: \"Ho Chi Minh City is very big.\""},"skillIds":["speaking","u10.grammar"],"type":"speakRepeat","vocabularyIds":["u6.big","u10.city"]},{"content":{"tokens":[{"id":"t1","text":"Huy"},{"id":"t2","text":"chồng"},{"id":"t3","text":"năm"},{"id":"t4","text":"này"},{"id":"t5","text":"thành"},{"id":"t6","text":"Tôi"},{"id":"t7","text":"phố"},{"id":"t8","text":"yêu"},{"id":"t9","text":"quyển"}]},"explanation":"Câu đúng: \"Tôi yêu thành phố này.\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctTokenIds":["t6","t8","t5","t7","t4"],"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"\"love\" = yêu; \"city\" = thành phố","id":"u10n7l2-e14","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Dịch sang tiếng Việt: \"I love this city.\""},"skillIds":["u10.grammar"],"type":"wordBank","vocabularyIds":["u2.love","u10.city"]},{"content":{"maxChars":200,"placeholder":"Viết bằng tiếng Anh"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"What is the name of this street?\". Cũng đúng: \"What's the name of this street?\".","gradingRule":{"acceptedText":["What is the name of this street?","What's the name of this street?"],"caseSensitive":false,"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":true},"hint":"\"name\" = tên; \"street\" = đường","id":"u10n7l2-e15","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Con đường này tên là gì?"},"skillIds":["u10.grammar"],"type":"textTranslation","vocabularyIds":["u1.name","u10.street"]}],"gradingRulesVersion":"g1","guideText":"Mẫu câu chính: \"Excuse me, where is the bank?\" (Xin lỗi, ngân hàng ở đâu?) — \"Go straight and turn left.\" (Đi thẳng rồi rẽ trái.) — \"Is it far?\" (Có xa không?)\nChỉ đường dùng câu mệnh lệnh: Go straight. Turn right. Turn left at the corner.\nVị trí: on the left / on the right (bên trái / bên phải), next to (bên cạnh), opposite (đối diện), near (gần), on the corner (ở góc đường).\n\"Near\" không cần \"to\": \"near the school\" (không nói \"near to the school\" trong văn nói chuẩn A2).\nHỏi khoảng cách: \"Is it far from here?\" — Trả lời: \"No, you can walk.\" (Không, bạn có thể đi bộ.)","lessonId":"u10n7l2","lessonVersion":"v2.u10n7l2","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u10n7","order":78,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u10n7l2","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec2","signature":"cMjt9tnyH0LA_NkWvhv1vJoBRtYZnES7CXXCQZS5vi_TGuULr5v_I36K2ZdbKED4ilbjFGC69vWylpJKYtRNBQ","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["u10.grammar","listening","speaking","u10.dialogue","reading","u10.story","u10.vocab"],"title":"Ôn tập cửa ải · Bài 2","unitId":"u10"}